       }
      ],
      "text": "Risk behaviors:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " many middle adolescents experiment w drug use or unsafe sexual behavior; those w a chronic illness may question whether their childhood meds are still needed; a driver's permit or license brings more freedom and unsupervised time."
     }
    ]
